、互动影视与游戏。依托前沿 AIGC 技术与互动叙事引擎，奇想无限构建从内容生成、体验创新到全球分发的全链路生态，形成“技术研发-内容生产-多渠道发行-商业变现”完整闭环，为创作者提供高效、低成本、高质量的 AI 内容生成解决方案，突破传统影视创作边界，为用户打造前所未有的沉浸式文化体验。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":12,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1654","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1654","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"164","BOARD_NAME":"山东板块","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":4,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0164","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0164","BOARD_TYPE":"板块","BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1638","BOARD_NAME":"最近多板","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":6,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1638","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1638","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1633","BOARD_NAME":"昨日高振幅","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":7,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1633","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1633","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1478","BOARD_NAME":"装修装饰Ⅲ","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":null,"BOARD_RANK":3,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1478","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1478","BOARD_TYPE":"行业","BOARD_LEVEL":"3"},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1209","BOARD_NAME":"建筑装饰","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":null,"BOARD_RANK":1,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1209","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1209","BOARD_TYPE":"行业","BOARD_LEVEL":"1"},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1151","BOARD_NAME":"短剧互动游戏","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2026年半年报显示，继真人短剧、AI短剧快速发展之后，视频影视内容生产成本急剧下降。互动影游凭借更强的沉浸感与更丰富的流量变现玩法，正成为各大平台争相抢夺的新一代流量风口。奇想无限已与国内头部平台开展互动影游试点共创项目，将第一时间上线各大平台，并将作为下一阶段重点推广方向。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":14,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1151","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1151","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1134","BOARD_NAME":"算力概念","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2026年半年报显示，德芯智算专注于为客户提供一站式、定制化的算力硬件解决方案，经营团队依托过往在高性能计算、硬件架构设计及散热优化领域的技术积累，能够为客户提供AI 算力服务器组装与贸易、GPU 显卡及存储类产品贸易等服务。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":15,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1134","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1134","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1111","BOARD_NAME":"AIGC概念","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2025年年报显示，控股公司奇想无限聚焦AIGC驱动的精品漫剧及仿真人漫剧内容生产制作，提供“技术研发-内容生产-多渠道发行-商业变现”的全链路解决方案。以自研AI智能体平台为核心生产工具，通过多模态大模型协同实现漫剧内容的高效、高品质、规模化量产，目前已形成玄幻、穿越、都市悬疑等多题材精品内容矩阵，并与头部IP平台、短视频平台建立深度合作关系。后续逐步拓展到互动影游制作、电商教育素材生成、文旅数字人交互、建筑设计渲染等AIGC技术应用前景巨大的行业领\n域。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":16,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1111","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1111","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1080","BOARD_NAME":"新型城镇化","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"公司主营业务为建筑装饰及房屋建筑工程的设计与施工。主要产品有公共建筑装饰、住宅装饰装修、古建筑工程、房屋建筑工程、市政工程。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":17,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1080","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1080","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"605287.SH","SECURITY_CODE":"605287","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"德才股份","BOARD_CODE":"1050","BOARD_NAME":"昨日涨停_含一字","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":8,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK1050","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI1050","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null}],"count":21},"success":true,"message":"ok","code":0}